<mxCell id="note" value="Legend: blue dashed = BGP control plane | green dashed = NCC attachment | red = inspected data plane&lt;br&gt;Key point: Cloud Router is control plane only; packets do not traverse Cloud Router. Learned dynamic routes make the Router Appliance VM the VPC next hop." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="850" width="1440" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
